<section class="card card-body extension-panel"><h2 class="card-title">발송 이력 <small><?= (int) $history['total'] ?>건</small></h2>
<form method="get" action="<?= $this->url('admin.messaging.sms.history') ?>"><input type="hidden" name="environment" value="<?= $this->e($environment) ?>"><div class="history-filters"><div><label class="extension-label" for="type">문자 유형</label><select class="select select-bordered select-block" id="type" name="type"><option value="">전체</option><?php foreach (['sms', 'lms'] as $type): ?><option value="<?= $this->e($type) ?>"<?= ($values['type'] ?? '') === $type ? ' selected' : '' ?>><?= $this->e(strtoupper($type)) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></div><div><label class="extension-label" for="status">접수 상태</label><select class="select select-bordered select-block" id="status" name="status"><option value="">전체</option><?php foreach (['prepared','sending','accepted','rejected','unknown'] as $status): ?><option value="<?= $this->e($status) ?>"<?= ($values['status'] ?? '') === $status ? ' selected' : '' ?>><?= $this->e($status_labels[$status]) ?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></div><div><label class="extension-label" for="from-date">시작일</label><input class="input input-bordered input-block" id="from-date" type="date" name="from" value="<?= $this->e(is_string($values['from'] ?? null) ? $values['from'] : '') ?>"></div><div><label class="extension-label" for="until-date">종료일</label><input class="input input-bordered input-block" id="until-date" type="date" name="until" value="<?= $this->e(is_string($values['until'] ?? null) ? $values['until'] : '') ?>"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">조회</button></div></form>
<p>접수됨은 업체가 요청을 받은 상태입니다. 실제 수신 여부는 도달 결과를 함께 확인해 주세요.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>요청 시각</th><th>문자 유형</th><th>수신번호</th><th>접수</th><th>도달</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($history['items'] as $item): ?><tr><td data-label="요청 시각"><a class="link" href="<?= $this->url('admin.messaging.sms.detail', ['id' => $item['id']]) ?>?environment=<?= $this->e($environment) ?>"><?= $this->e($time($item['created_at'])) ?></a></td><td data-label="문자 유형"><?= $this->e(strtoupper($item['channel'])) ?></td><td data-label="수신번호"><?= $this->e($item['phone_mask'] !== '' ? $item['phone_mask'] : '보관 만료') ?></td><td data-label="접수"><?= $this->e($status_labels[$item['submission']] ?? $item['submission']) ?></td><td data-label="도달"><?= $this->e($status_labels[$item['delivery']] ?? $item['delivery']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach ?>
<?php if ($history['items'] === []): ?><tr><td colspan="5">조회된 발송이 없습니다.</td></tr><?php endif ?></tbody></table></div>
<?php $query = ['environment' => $environment]; foreach (['status','from','until','type'] as $key) if (is_string($values[$key] ?? null)) $query[$key] = $values[$key]; ?>
<nav><?php if ($history['page'] > 1): ?><a class="link" href="?<?= $this->e(http_build_query($query + ['page' => $history['page'] - 1])) ?>">이전</a><?php endif ?><?php if ($history['page'] * 20 < $history['total']): ?><a class="link" href="?<?= $this->e(http_build_query($query + ['page' => $history['page'] + 1])) ?>">다음</a><?php endif ?></nav>
<?php if ($page === 'sms-history'): ?><form method="post" action="<?= $this->url('admin.messaging.sms.history') ?>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $this->e($csrf_token) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="environment" value="<?= $this->e($environment) ?>"><p>테스트·운영 환경에서 90일이 지난 문자의 수신정보와 메시지 내용을 최대 100건씩 삭제합니다. 중복 방지 식별자와 결과는 유지합니다.</p><button name="action" value="purge" class="secondary btn">보관 만료 개인정보 정리</button></form><?php endif ?></section>
